{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9a24b52524d6594581f53c25da686c0fe01e29e83f170f3e91c4b6719c8e4cb9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:853ab75db1aa9ca0bab7149e58931d08d9b5147e1891df42476286653a77ab77",
      "text": "第一次工作",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cc7643b6d1fcdecde7887ea440ff092f8e99400f5ef5057eae34f1de3ddc45",
      "text": "制作人努力推销的结果，\n终于迎来了指名C.FIRST的第一份工作委托。\n为了让老旧的玩具店起死回生，\n秀、百百人、锐心3人竭尽所能去挑战这份工作。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000009:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000009:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:853ab75db1aa9ca0bab7149e58931d08d9b5147e1891df42476286653a77ab77",
      "text": "第一次工作",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d7278adc1fe1b3f7d1cb75ebab6bdd977ef83a9ce2a8ae0273f79ecd77f7e54",
      "text": "新曲也顺利完成了，\n315 Production终于要正式启动了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9781e07fa88d17c618bc86f9a40b35787078dd966755bd306ff1d9bbe1426ea",
      "text": "请看，制作人。\n已经收到了好几份工作委托哦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b95cf05c5fc989f29e078b565bf5d5604614f5a3cc16cee72bb4d26ac23065ad",
      "text": "特别是希望采访在前一份职业时\n就已经很有名的偶像的请求好像很多。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:785e880788b4f705e56c7ea7b6726b88e46b8f1bc6319c9b7d135f6b97ec2bf5",
      "text": "那个名人为什么会转行当偶像！？\n大家一定都很好奇吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:856d799d7001fde4c02b09e559a438eec40e79da68bbbdf466bea338fb6fd6fb",
      "text": "原来如此……我们要继续积极推销，\n提高事务所的知名度！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07d5525e44c90c8e0d08810a1b267efa06a40082f82d8679052ef9f80f51c68f",
      "text": "大家！今天能来我们的舞台，\n谢谢你们！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba96843be75b85b0e33be33fa60db49104a8ae7ddca5fef008427d019c20bb82",
      "text": "全新起步的我们315 Production，\n今后就拜托大家多多关照啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:619f9158e1291afb2d256f00b71a491ae37c5a83c52e1f4a69ff2e5302fd46c6",
      "text": "成了偶像的我们所属的\n315 Production！大家请多关照啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6f6915092ed6c7ef02f1ffd4118d4631d96d405647ebdb1e4b633dbcb86f0c0",
      "text": "首先去搜索看看吧。\n其他组合也请多多支持哦♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e166c1087ca24a835706d8d32b56d25a9d015183293f4cc2c5c9ce5ad9f49b85",
      "text": "喵喵！在此为了让大家\n更了解我们一点。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2925abf65d049e185f1eee6de2279df26f805b2cc5d72eea507a18420f8384b",
      "text": "就由我来表演一段以315 Production为题材的\n新落语喵～！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fbec922965970e761a07fcff2dbdc015d68797fdc8072c8d6df9e24aa756737",
      "text": "……好的！虽然我们是一家崭新的事务所，\n但目前有整整49位极具魅力的偶像在开展活动。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1770e73f032e969a0ff98b7865da66cd63428565a7d47e57234000bfd9e3f1ff",
      "text": "下次也务必请让我们一起合作……\n好的！请您多多考虑！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000169:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000177:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d96bb64fa6160c26bc621083e7bf398ece684713735f11db2498a092214930bb",
      "text": "喂喂，是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n我是花音哦♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000179:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d79eb76187650b180e3c8881b323aed6edd73bc5267cf158bd05d3ca6fc50c63",
      "text": "今天工作也辛苦啦～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ec620ccd75f13b1629ad57551ed9980bf6847763bb916b58b4bce37fcfcc67",
      "text": "我跟你说哦，今天我见到了好多\n做模特的朋友呢～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000183:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c12ecb1fb9b62da11d54279c1d613ce192ae7f6c7cb5315a615a90662cc9638",
      "text": "大家都是很努力工作的孩子，\n所以花音也向他们介绍了315 Production的事情哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000185:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d2bf8fa0338729179491a4c52ae5be8d592c2a630970d01d6ea6366a4f914c6",
      "text": "无论是●●●●プロデューサー的事，\n还是我们大家的事……我都做了好多宣传哦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000187:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed2872dc24e30f344888c4ce13ce852a01961cff534a8f33f60db7c0eb37990",
      "text": "所以要是能来好多好多工作就好了呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13d6a3ec5c314a4f132459951df5a32ca21df5251823c32aaf22801fd0a29b05",
      "text": "真是太可靠了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27a569d87e2c9127d5b32f0e6a0cb045e1dcbf3875ece39465cc3d3611950828",
      "text": "真的吗？花音也帮上大家的忙了吗～？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000194:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60a070778ba5f5591b6a81a22622a533810217db48921882a063430815d2b026",
      "text": "花音也是很想呢？和直央君还有志狼君一起，\n做很多很多开心的工作。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:637922a29966b10785a186c428a8603d7756f49acdd1fd6235796afe9679cc13",
      "text": "所以，今后我也会继续努力宣传的哦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2298213c340e749e1d25dcaca1afe94b33e514cc2ad2919aefb8b24234bda0ab",
      "text": "那么，●●●●プロデューサー。\n明天也要好～好地夸夸我哦！拜拜♪",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49f9ee8175347d551af39b4d01a4d052870fdc08fdbc8fe5acdfb110b93dc2b6",
      "text": "呼，邮件回复完了。稍微伸个懒腰……\n哎呀呀！不行，全身都僵硬了……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e29c782bb555613e89f9e4816ce28f3fd99cfc0681a35eb7d66f7aeb8149ae8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n辛苦啦，我们刚回来哦～……等等。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:958c61eea69a7dd835e146e96a9f91a83dab2f9e6974d8b60045c70824b3c119",
      "text": "Oh！怎么了●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n那个pose，so mysterious呢☆",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6959d35e5ba1e2a6e226276e67e9f90b5b8abe5aafd04424e852006555b73cea",
      "text": "各位辛苦了。\n没有啦，只是肩膀稍微有点酸痛……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a11747b996b3308caa20444b5cc048e36ca4b130dbe601579f72e0daf029d06",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n你拼尽全力制作我们的心意，我一直很感谢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec6fd5dada4c503df6c2f6d3601ab44a4eddb78dd09ff7ae282594d7c5f30c4",
      "text": "但是，工作不是该由一个人独自承担的东西。\n而是该与同伴一同解决、一同跨越的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecbb0d2dbe9f5add5e4a65f8f9b0073765284fd148b8ba75eb0c5ddc2e7d5666",
      "text": "没错没错，可不准一个人勉强哦？\n遇到什么事，前教师随时都可以给你当咨询对象的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd6fe27c52be29434cd088bf7106f52108ba62aad5b76b0bd93b191805d51412",
      "text": "谢谢大家！……咦？\n就在刚才，来了一封新的工作委托邮件……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0a72505144ff91ea9beb139e775b0cc7dd12c58aa07fe6d9db5c79c1d6857ac",
      "text": "真的吗！？也给我们看看！\n呃～，写了什么写了什么～……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e51724648bf0613c28418aaa578a232f37954724d203238721a909c385d93369",
      "text": "委托的内容是……\n“请为我的店做宣传”……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a9f712a3364d30be4119f514193a75034674789843c40bc60014357d4de41e",
      "text": "指名委托的组合是……哦哦～！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_b:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0d12672d8f8475e08199f4a3325be4d5240963e53bfa31ad9475c89a4841d36",
      "text": "太棒了……是那3个人哦！\nC.FIRST的第一份工作来了～！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000008:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4200ec0b8eae31e0e875596f30cd85ab0ca39bc9975df396f554bc3c39628522",
      "text": "秀的家",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa4921d9055d7e9493c6a8176f81fecf36198aeac06e7296bffda7e70f2f64b5",
      "text": "头发这样整理可以了吧。\n不对，这边还是再稍微卷一下……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b3622d10b004e85cbbb21c06e41ebc1793bd26a4fe6d0b16bdba28dc5288118",
      "text": "服装听说会在现场发，\n随身物品……都带齐了吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fa4feec87662c14790888612294c42b04d5f2e822223cf75458bd12cedd286a",
      "text": "没问题的。\n和平常一样，换成我肯定能完美搞定。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5e7c27120789c66df21b40cd9859ff5c76cdb6ff431a315a4c61a0c5bf994e",
      "text": "…………\n不过，姑且还是遵守一下“我的规则”吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83b3a79438a09242ca06472f558a72e462045b985f253fe52706da92a0d29029",
      "text": "秀，今天是什么重要的日子吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f90e5f5c255df65e180d95f2635cf954fc6897cde86e30ef0d58d47b20831973",
      "text": "！爷爷。\n……算是吧，你看得出来？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0828a7220a5025b3b1ec3238253d3a66041892c16791bf5fe7b764feea718d1f",
      "text": "当然看得出啦。秀在重要的日子里，总是\n想先从右脚开始穿鞋嘛。要加油哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58f9340b1f5ea7f1f0a6994acef783d3873e3b54ed50687449bddc690909d070",
      "text": "……嗯，谢谢。\n我出门了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d2830488ad3b05a558d4112305baf8442044f8ec20531da8bc454752e9d1a1",
      "text": "（没错，今天是重要的一天。毕竟……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67b0a92189a502b66c0a789f76d3add979f3f5e9477a4d4c565e96d6eacae339",
      "text": "昨天收到了指名各位的工作委托。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8484bec2396adb79af9f477f37782179bfd6255707cf77b8084bb88243fc71c5",
      "text": "委托人是\n一位经营玩具店的男性……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fcdbadd7c8037dd41cbf316e2cac57157f7849c8db1a9f8e899c7cc4e1fc075",
      "text": "（今天可是我的第一份工作……换句话说）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_c:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:768872fbb91d1b26da9b37430169d37dbb3367d283a2b37acff98c66f2345727",
      "text": "（是让我自己的存在被全世界所知晓的第一步！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b809a4b8d995c63348dd51113415c07adc6641b228c12c3f638b3884be4ed58d",
      "text": "老旧的玩具店",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a6103d5acf676a6c59e422991abef71f46d94255b4ea9dfc79690eccb25617a",
      "text": "哎呀……真没想到，\n你们真的会来啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52e009dcd2a06618482e5903820ddfb49ce3e0c298d08b3cde596a50f35dd44c",
      "text": "我是在电视上看到有像你们这样\n闪闪发光的年轻孩子们的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:598efcaf1fd11cbe35f34a42a36e8bb1cd30243ffbb0feb7e2bb1defcfded9ef",
      "text": "好像是叫偶像来着吧。我就想如果能让你们帮忙宣传，\n这家店是不是也能重新热闹起来呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8e0d8cdaba1bf9ee5a3f0abf5c647a9ff459a4f833885d33b4023dd46a9d403",
      "text": "应该由我们向您致谢才对，感谢您的委托！\n能马上跟我们聊聊关于这家店的情况吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad8eaa81868f8db2be080b37a4e3d6cc74f7430a0021d2f4eee6dca833ead40c",
      "text": "（哼，真是家相当怀旧的店啊……我家的\n爷爷，以前也是玩这种玩具长大的吗）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea57bd79a36e3a6c572ffa22bd7a4ef575aaacdd25029567037ef51c17e353ac",
      "text": "（……●●●●●●●●●●P酱的声音，\n好安心。好想一直听下去）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77c7c5b8a03b0a3be5c2ca680f64f0a577d43bb2d1e4e9cb56c3b1a376690e1b",
      "text": "（确实，以当今这个时代来说真是少见的商品阵容。\n要让这里起死回生的话……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:667aa87aad5a45cd283341eb69e63f711b84741d88a4fb28c3e9d4d2c66d1c47",
      "text": "……事情就是这样，我想再看一次\n像从前那样挤满了孩子们的店铺啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1622004b8c017a615f993a038a8942b5c157b36f7758abca130e42aa27ba3be5",
      "text": "也许这是个强人所难的请求，\n但能不能借我一份力量呢……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_d:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6689143e8b7a4ef648a45b30bc1109d1813f51c072b66c4e5eeaff767151ca5a",
      "text": "请交给我们吧。\n我们今天来，正是为了助您一臂之力的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ee159da4c218d2dc73143b4b4afe61c399f52b024cc2ef99b814a55ee7192ba",
      "text": "会议室",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c0b38747c456f94a8ae350d2aa8e2d1568fe2d6189b30cd7ee2fabace283a8",
      "text": "重新讨论一下吧。\n关于为那家店招揽大量孩子的方法。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a7b2411285a37baada06947e5d0fd90bb78e60f1aa8167def8264433e681927",
      "text": "我们虽然是偶像，但也才刚起步。\n就算报出名字，恐怕也起不到多大的宣传效果吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:021a95281a3fd64f7c9b183cc87039bd7953a047ac759ef3ea0285b50bf2975d",
      "text": "那么，我认为需要活用那家店特性的\n活动或企划。……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcb3242a0e5280f0ef6726e632f37554ac9a17c351595a8f6999fc2478427e62",
      "text": "抱歉，光是我一个人在说了。\n百百人、秀，你们有什么看法？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3a65c9e03ea7d3eb72fe6752ca2510ff3964fd602fa295efbd84f38c81ab138",
      "text": "这个嘛，既然主题是玩具，\n我很想听听最年少君的想法呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e1ad7f1d04e629e70e90a5ddf585e98de88369b83256083f5ad6c9117d2f1f1",
      "text": "天峰君，你怎么看？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2478894c31988251c1796df3071ee9920cacde21a485e41384aea5fb30f77d77",
      "text": "嗯～……虽然我挺喜欢手机游戏的，\n但对那种玩具不太了解啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8feb4dde7dfe323755de6cccbd91cdc1814f4d79984fc9e9c3d5302b7d23b1d",
      "text": "大人大概会觉得很怀念吧。\n可是，这次是想聚集小孩子对吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d87d606dd9e648c65049a5b8b486500105a513ecb70f58aa0153b340d25907b",
      "text": "拿让人搞不懂的老旧玩具来办活动，\n总觉得根本吸引不了兴趣啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05f95b4f39c013bfb4e68abd06116d9dce851598245e3f73aa17562f60ad6d86",
      "text": "……啊。\n那说不定是个很好的提示哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76df60d4946de9a62c8ed4e543d5e81ce6f3c4176f1fb96cda61e4e008fa3ed4",
      "text": "小孩子不来那家店，\n其实不正是因为“搞不懂怎么玩”吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d9120214daf81814864ba97a4eaa2b71b6309d7f861e49b52bb5bcb543c63c",
      "text": "一边教他们“这要这样玩哦～”一边\n一起玩的话，说不定会很有趣呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9debb299bdb82d8c0f9d8ac3253317291f38cc63d6be956f0baf0dd8348d8132",
      "text": "也就是由偶像来教大家玩法的\n“玩具大会活动”呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5806dfc345cb76c72170e8939cd3bd6a47f0e7ee4d18beb1cf888c3aa7d20cd1",
      "text": "但是为了做到这一点，我们自己也必须\n去学习关于玩具的知识才行呢……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3b3fb98335121e033c2330e623ab1c9ef8b95e3c39d62411bae01d3e31030b",
      "text": "换作我们根本小菜一碟啦。无论是玩具还是别的什么，\n马上就能展现出专业级水准给你们看。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000150:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000157:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcd41bac222f45898eb2cdae8cf86468a9da4908f6a84f9898fcca4342febb2f",
      "text": "各自汇报一下\n练习的进展",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000159:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27f8e58977e7b45c33c94f60dc025cb2034f85b2a38ac7afe84cb29f33444f43",
      "text": "我在练贝独乐。\n已经能转得相当好了哦",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000163:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6904d59bbf97f3ab0efecfa2e02999e61986a6257d621fee49fac218777492f8",
      "text": "你们两个呢？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000165:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cee4ac920e5bff5dccb289c3c34a5e2ca797bc226f787e0cb3753743b806b3f4",
      "text": "悠悠球。\n我已经能做出\n超级水准的花式了哦～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000167:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b34ac57f0ae2f8234d1f07bdef7f137bf704e778b514e62b22795c6229adbfff",
      "text": "我在练习剑玉。\n上级水准的技巧\n基本全都掌握了",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000169:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:509025d29fece2ed9017a2643ecc20b12959a01c6d0556c55085881220eb8f2e",
      "text": "各位都很乐在其中呢",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c808a0002957d94908b5919994b785e234e4d2d6eef940b90620b0d2b4ad7c5",
      "text": "意外地挺好玩\n这个我休息日好像也会玩。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000174:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f736b9ce18a65b480439200dc6a104053ad9f825c837063845ffb1bcf324bca",
      "text": "话说回来，你们两个平时\n休息日都在做什么？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:788c1ce0bcba7fa958983d0ef0ce21e45f762e3d1c273c4fc7c6a5f88e7934a6",
      "text": "看看漫画、看看动画\n还有打打游戏之类的吧",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84563995209d5579ec39ac09b4fba3bfe85b7ac2924499a119791ec80a343513",
      "text": "出席熟人的派对，\n或者去开水上摩托车",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_e:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1bf738430986d1bd3561be13f177bfa41c71d4dc4c228102c6fd6e2d506146c",
      "text": "只有一个人画风完全不一样～",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1568b7b7dac24c42b8cd8640d33176a43aede70e8b0710cf236df367c2cc29d",
      "text": "距离玩具大会还有一个月……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c2658ce3b317dc49130d32c3225de6e50722e8e28022df99a40fc68e4c38d2",
      "text": "这个绕法、这个角度，完美。\n贝独乐的必胜法……让你们见识一下！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a21ee5dbe0470ac2cfcea13e2227300e74818f235d3a1941246e08b16120b3",
      "text": "……预备！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74fd222c056f74ba2230b23ad411d815e1adc9b1e4b419abf4eb6cf2821f2a49",
      "text": "是我赢了呢。\n怎么了一年级学生会长，刚才那个就是必胜法吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed8c1e60e577f3b70c44042e5fbdcc380f14336e58b07d26bbc2cbc515b50f1",
      "text": "……道夫先生，打扰一下。关于绕绳的方法，\n我还想再多请教一下……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48d3d8ee2b3f91d98808d88997475c5deacf50d0ffcad46b5f7bac6f96c7a36c",
      "text": "嗯。不行，天峰君。已经这个时间了。\n先把玩具收拾好，稍微休息一下。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efb2498994416ef15e1f2eb9cceff5453f719058b16b2b04ad3288f9aa27823c",
      "text": "……好～的……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae29bcb9d4b39fa2395ce9193dd2942138267749676be609bf6ae9ce426ecaf",
      "text": "道夫先生，这次真的非常感谢您。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fadcd4269787421b2ae1a7f0fd8244a51321d0ea59cfaafe9da6e5f2d6f25d0",
      "text": "没想到S.E.M的各位居然会\n来协助特训玩具玩法。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd5ac3fc341a98e6bf601a4ad7ca50a1b6a6a748a9f374d00f68fd910256cfe6",
      "text": "没关系。在教导学业的同时，也教导如何玩耍。\n这也是我们大人的义务吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7165c2376fe1ef3a6fede2ad04325c641adb1a97b9ae38d06139db2b7c63af2a",
      "text": "而且……我自己，\n也感到非常怀念呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15be3bf24efd69969913a11ff17d64d45bdd2dbc95d28d004e11b34716a32163",
      "text": "啊……请看。不仅道夫先生，\n类先生和次郎先生看起来也玩得非常开心呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc82c7af7d7eccd488723848d255dc1aed33efa1824afe2c51b09a22943e0c36",
      "text": "Oh no！Mr. 山下，再来一局！\n就再来一次……对啦，接下来用剑玉决胜负吧☆",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998015ff5f732325ff605b9bd177c718f458132b44f36ff318eb09a27074c194",
      "text": "哎～，怎么办好呢～？\n那下次输的人可要请客吃烤肉哦～？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000190:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:746f5f0219b742062f59d63fd90e3e00a765522ad290a46294de826f62f4e665",
      "text": "……咳咳。我也，有那么沉浸在\n童心里吗……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb03f3751ebbf2012766bbcdb1c0a3a1315777f09858cb5bf23d0016430fff80",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱。\n给，这个送～给你。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfd2a2433f4ecd81d77058ead86ad841423fd256ea8ad2266c1ad70818108792",
      "text": "是陀螺吗？\n……啊，上面画着我的肖像画呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce73c44a22a79334a4e27aeda73c70e9348185a1f8bb369fe5594b852ba1b151",
      "text": "我还画了凑成一对的爱心标志哦。\n呵呵，喜欢吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a4244ac20959bf650698a159acab1bca024552b1e87c999c3a7348de2528f1f",
      "text": "嘿……虽然听说过你画画很厉害，\n但这也太超乎想象了吧。看，这里画得超级像。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7affadc2eade493660be6d4c4d423da01f572649dbb992c3b8bf6909c7de28a",
      "text": "哎～。这种程度根本没什么大不了的啦。\n天峰君不也画得出来吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea88d91cc46d565fb002bc5728f77e895f6cbb00b621806d84bf968000016f57",
      "text": "……百百人，你为什么对自己的实力没有自信？\n初次见面的时候也是这样。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b6e6b76a4d8ae3f27d52045509f924f088288a1ec6f8b6dc407efd9bf8ce19d",
      "text": "…………因为，真的\n没有达到那种值得被夸赞的水平啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe1defe1e65502ef69ec1fa2b00f4db49cd57e3e9a908123cd4406a5c059f34d",
      "text": "而且我，已经经由●●●●●●●●●●P酱的手\n作为偶像脱胎换骨了哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aef082a60d51a953dfd84da03016fd5be8f64ea965ef81fa0dd59ed1a87ecf11",
      "text": "稍微会画一点画而已，\n事到如今已经毫无关……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75e27988dd830f916baf89f803191aca443a0d07daf1aa25a26a23cc4d81a55",
      "text": "不，这是一份了不起的才能！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33612990338a7634b278017a4eab5333445f12fea93ce2f140d72234297e3b4c",
      "text": "觉得怎么样呢，给来到活动现场的\n孩子们现场画画。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e",
      "text": "哎……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f017294c897c9664aea2b4ca71e282afd002194f14ebb1b38710f665eaa6aa",
      "text": "（那岂不是……如果，我画得不够好）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab1e45174efbf2b8ac25739c5bbde3dab1a1d2c57789e6cbc02b5609cde2f31e",
      "text": "（我，会被●●●●●●●●●●P酱\n抛弃吗……？）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4321fd2331f02f7cc071170f68eb7e49657a6ec649d94e4f207f211220e673f9",
      "text": "（可是，●●●●●●●●●●P酱刚才，\n说我有才能……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27d9d0e9157ad58bf4caf75ae0449f7a186f1f22bb942e713b7e220f2e2dd365",
      "text": "嗯……我会考虑看看的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000180:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77c9321d60626a1acb7399dac7bfb042041fa55de873c43b4e6d60892eab670e",
      "text": "啊……是●●●●●●●●●●P酱吗？\n抱歉哦，突然打电话过来。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000190:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbb9595eb992f4e0eb1c6cce03548f97abfde3ec1398f1da8dce855179d041f5",
      "text": "刚才说的那个，给来参加大会的人\n画画的提议……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d22c87184984f090e9da6c20f16ec10e4218a43ca666948b8c0b4734e62ad013",
      "text": "……我，想尝试着做做看。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000194:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1297f5d7afe0b98c98e7d3b07edad92a12272a53c01f8dc7165659a135a9bb74",
      "text": "大家一定会很高兴的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000197:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a01e523213c23007ff2fc9a7c2ebd4f6248d92b2ba1fb09093168e188af470b4",
      "text": "是、这样吗。\n虽然我并没有什么自信……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000199:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ec04acd296641aeb9f2268f349f190c2e276954fe9c539e6707543638fe59df",
      "text": "可是，如果●●●●●●●●●●P酱\n能这么对我说的话，我就会有努力的干劲了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfe5da913e30254dc59aeedefe8cc5720254b3a5d29e9b6f5390b67ee6b2d336",
      "text": "我虽然没有任何才能……\n但只要是你说的，我什么都会做。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000203:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe96c5b3f5cd148c9c21a471f1fd2b8e06b4ce9ccc7adaf7a4fba88e4552c202",
      "text": "我已经这么决定了。\n……所以呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000205:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16c068a4314f3a428203fa6e862f14d759eaec8cc4680acff9235eca77d59ef4",
      "text": "要是，我做得不够好的话……你可以不要生我的气吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000207:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那当然了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_g:cmd-000210:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca2677b7f51603d2f7cd9becce0243c0de3c3d682d574dc145def9fde86f003c",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n我……会试试看的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49c27eee389ca2930c196c5faac66564edf58b4c9e31a209373d4f2601cd1498",
      "text": "抱歉啊，连贴海报都让你们帮忙。\n不过，多亏了你们，现在已经成话题了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be01c4ffc55fd59cff37b024e14770165d4a84edfe84ae691b62ecd02fdfd722",
      "text": "大会虽然还有一阵子才开，但来店里的孩子\n已经变多了……总觉得我已经心满意足了啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b958bd0dc28508da8d6c2e9c22e865eeb37f54a0330624101f8b15774eba554b",
      "text": "说什么呢，正式演出现在才刚要开始吧。\n我们可是有把活动办得大获成功的自信呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d767c97c26b3ecd8205ad9e1b79c6f8e53e2198a12638e83a6c69b7bfd2ba82f",
      "text": "就是说啊，老爷爷。\n好好期待当天的到来吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77d85397cf574fc54d7aa08838d2f125b2faa006f93be22a02e4b38f9121a784",
      "text": "……秀、百百人。能耽误一下吗。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6c9b5d26fc3de17bb5008bc667ca45c31d17d6eaa597b31125118114483e32",
      "text": "关于大会的宣传，\n有些事正是因为是我们才能做到的。……例如。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:062292ef562a35f42215fb618efc1f6183023084d0ca25bc96ebca9924f9cc48",
      "text": "要不要试着向身边的人寻求协助？\n我打算明天在晨会上向全校学生进行呼吁。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3a5c09ca55955789e7558c4c1b8ba7af43c5b563158f6f463e65cc5cbd1e34",
      "text": "呵呵，真是学生会长特权呢。那我也\n试着去拜托一下学校里的大家吧～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8841bbeb63d3f58af77753a43bf2730091de5caa295399fa079790c3c55c3a5f",
      "text": "拜托了。滥用权力固然不是值得称赞的行为，\n但现在比起这个，我更想去实现那位店主的梦想。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:802841aa575d2157a948ae2ff4c990b203477ef2e3e0dcde36a74c03af611261",
      "text": "（……怎么办。我跟学校里的那些家伙，\n又没有那么熟络）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000153:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef8f1e31c8467728b4c8fa74211a3d722659cd5a36daacc78cd44c94b9b54f3",
      "text": "秀的房间",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5910f6bac24dfdb5748b08ddd047e10a9b556c68a6a765697e2205c9569a9658",
      "text": "……说起来，班里的人好像拉我进过一个\n群聊来着。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f40bc0538578c73d6a9c62f94aef155eb3be8b2ee6cc6158a9f74f3cabfa5148",
      "text": "（虽然一直晾在一边，试着在里面宣传一下吧。\n大概写成这样……好，多少会有点反应吧）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd0d915efaa1a707455d5e0b9bd3d305e40d32da9b2094431795e51544db65e",
      "text": "哎，不过啊……这可是我第一次发消息，\n甚至有可能都没人认得出是我……等等，哇。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf1e664fac7c8f75e9c1eb967d5621786e7c1f7b3cbaff8b04574d4b2d3785a1",
      "text": "（回复正以惊人的势头刷屏。\n“终于联系我们了！”“绝对去！”这样啊）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e78f318a9920d3edf3bff464fd128d1f187e4e24c226d3954d503d971654d6",
      "text": "真是的。大家也未免太喜欢我了吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000213:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f3d1ee4ab319c16a983a90e114f4bf2c6f1a7e4b97bc763edaa1999b8ceeab",
      "text": "（……喂，挚友。\n你也，多少给点反应啊）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08b114715f5e8f2800f7e8ece78057ce0d46ecbe1e7581b06563691db23040db",
      "text": "玩具大会当天……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86c3ca6cfbad1b5e59b3a2d39f22e05b466d024955321e8b35097bc09b92d52",
      "text": "看好了吗？拿法是这样，架势是这样。\n然后转的时候……要用尽全力！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b713b6950ea5b32c552fc4bc0f61bd02925e53f98c0e287cb5e9d784cc251859",
      "text": "哇……！好可爱！\n大哥哥，谢谢你帮我画画！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8ea2fc77a27044b6793d525a3ca32150f6646d4008f2618e548ea5b7666eaf",
      "text": "……嗯。不用谢哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ab1c26470dbfa3d75cb2a18c993b0332ab19a7cb054966dd4fed01fe3c2b195",
      "text": "可恶！这小哥超级强的啊！\n绝对是邪恶的大BOSS！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c12d950bed27a404b42cf821f66f142cfef2073abcf6449cb4c854fb135885d",
      "text": "ほう，眼神不错嘛。\n没错，我就是本次大会的最终BOSS。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c4fa8547c44fa28e25d4f45bc84bf6848bad98cff707937ebc62cec490e5d64",
      "text": "能打倒我的人会有特别的礼物哦。\n来，下一个来挑战的是谁？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:712e6f03ab4d84d9170120519b97092937a42c34991eba71b87e7121e9cc2b87",
      "text": "（气氛太热烈了……！\n活动大获成功呢！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000099:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dc0928d76e771eff502e9081ff0e6aaa81ef5b133cc40968105fdb958735079",
      "text": "玩具大会结束后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2b2eefcb238fc2c3b9f7f905d68d15d1d8c11e68b7b29c9895236f174df40a4",
      "text": "你们几个，今天真是太谢谢了。\n那些看起来那么开心的孩子们，居然有那么多……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0b97d26cc1dd6d19e490cd37b65b59452cc407bd6d9ee591e7986ab909d2ada",
      "text": "……让我觉得一直坚持到今天没有放弃，\n真是太好了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e59e20b48a419af855642281afe63224ab7827da6c1ad39c7124ef2b48761813",
      "text": "不必言谢。对我们而言，\n也度过了一段很有意义的时光。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b788bd53e1007e13a78b4d9877bcf4dd414c4543cd9afa57d4cd9217b507ca14",
      "text": "是啊。\n明明是工作，我却觉得超级开心呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77a969ddcd3a3651fca26406fe8af15e9e4052c572851289803b71744af33861",
      "text": "……我也是。第一份工作是在\n爷爷的店里，真是太好了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_i:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e027658ddb48c30b7946ade8149084a677513aa0c2a3bd6e86690b41b713032d",
      "text": "各位，今天非常感谢大家！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cdedb2544b3c64faab55a12de627559faacfccd34999f3777795ff3521edefc",
      "text": "玩具大会过去几天后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6854715312c00dad54893791f9dc4332a5ad6cb1f83df4d15a953b8ea6f09861",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱，快看快看。\n我们登上当地的宣传志了哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f7aba3d75a3bce63d2545aed6a2712c152e115640c19d20aa951f619b8e799f",
      "text": "为历史悠久的玩具店重夺光彩的\n偶像界新旋风！……啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48efc08157e84bfa22b1e7094c0653b1024767bb69cd141311b838fafeb651d7",
      "text": "虽说并不是一听到偶像时，自己所想象的那种\n光鲜亮丽的工作就是了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4691a18ef9ed6258e2af3e7f09fac19806f4f98a127274338c4bacd6c0146a79",
      "text": "……但超级开心，做了真是太好了。\n对大家来说，也是一次很好的经验吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922e321d0eb75661d0c7126cebaeafaf764d67b6d73e302b9583167e801e398f",
      "text": "说起来，画作礼物在玩累了的女孩子们中\n大受欢迎呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34752efd5a53e866b42778e889e37c347d605728d2a955547b0484d7b80dec0d",
      "text": "感谢你，百百人。\n那些孩子能绽放笑容，都是多亏了你。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bb0ecd3ed92075f2c3a63258326efbd3ac18d7b009fa3d8d0b75c076af72874",
      "text": "……真是的，别再提我的事啦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0668bfe2197d588a2e29de4294573c2c695bb6a03f9b90c7fd39f2f9eb0cf157",
      "text": "各位，第一份工作辛苦了！\n那么，关于接下来……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17d49c6dc709dc94027f2b594c8a1359fc210c39ff2d5c4e0e8f9c7e58dd9323",
      "text": "其实，有一份315 Production想要全员齐心协力\n去拿下的重大工作。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15b775b2b3301da52adcf3ef0386aa672b7447a7cb03139e9a950139c1b896c",
      "text": "……关于“JAPAN IDOL FES”，\n请允许我向大家说明一下！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
